    // Also need to handle RUST_BACKTRACE? If set, print extra? Original prints "stack backtrace:\nnote: Some details..." for "1", and addresses for "full". For simplicity, check env var and mimic original's behavior for "1" (no frames) and "full" (dummy?).
    // Actually original's RUST_BACKTRACE=1 output has no frames (just header and note). Let's mimic: if RUST_BACKTRACE is set (to "1" or "full" or other?), print accordingly.
